# Same game as barrowgoyf-mills-that-many-and-keeps-a-creature: Bot2's Lightning Bolt (instant), Bot1's Duress (sorcery)
# and Bot2's Mountain discarded to hand size (land) make Barrowgoyf a 3/4 when it attacks on turn 7, unblocked.
# Bot1 accepts and mills an Island, a Swamp and another Swamp: no creature card among them, so no card is chosen and
# the hand is unchanged by the trigger. Milling a land adds no new type to the graveyards (a land is already there).

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Duress
Barrowgoyf
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Island
Swamp
Swamp
Guerrilla Gorilla
Swamp x2

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Duress.Cast(Bot2)
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#3.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Barrowgoyf.Cast
[T7 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Barrowgoyf)
Bot1.Accept

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 17
Bot1.Graveyard = Swamp; Swamp; Island; Duress
Bot1.Hand.Count = 5
Bot1.Library.Count = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Barrowgoyf.Power = 3
